# Sample requests. Works in VS Code (REST Client), Rider and Visual Studio.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@id = 01a19f11-497f-7d15-be9e-ea8646018b5c

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create a shipment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "referenceNumber": "SHP-1001",
  "origin": "Chicago, IL",
  "destination": "Dallas, TX",
  "weightKg": 1250.5
}

### List shipments (paged, optional status filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shipments?page=1&pageSize=20&status=Created

### Get one shipment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shipments/{{id}}

### Update details (only while Created)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shipments/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "Chicago, IL",
  "destination": "Houston, TX",
  "weightKg": 1305
}

### Move to InTransit
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shipments/{{id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "InTransit" }

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shipments/{{id}}
